<<<
+ to shrink from the word as if it were a newfangled derivative of eruption like the clipped words in BACK- FORMATION; it has in fact been in good use for some centuries.
===
+ to shrink from the word as if it were a newfangled derivative of *eruption* like the clipped words in ^^BACK-FORMATION^^; it has in fact been in good use for some centuries.
>>>

