<<<
for especial to disappear & for special to take its place; it may be said that special is now possible in all senses, though especial is stiil also possible or preferable in the senses (a) exceptional in degree,
===
for *especial* to disappear & for *special* to take its place; it may be said that *special* is now possible in all senses, though *especial* is still also possible or preferable in the senses (a) exceptional in degree,
>>>

<<<
as My especial friend is Jones, He handles the matier with especial dexterity, Oxford architecture receives especial attention, (b) of,
